  {
   "id": "sticky-business-240514@major-2024-06-20",
   "gameId": "sticky-business-240514",
   "displayName": "Free Pride Update Live",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-06-20T17:41:40.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Fellow Stickies!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today, we're celebrating two attributes that are part of our DNA which we incorporated into Sticky Business: free & unconditional love + Games Made in Germany.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🌈To properly celebrate this, we got a little treat for you! 🌈",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Celebrate Pride Month with Sticky Business and explore the free Pride Update! Dive into the joy of managing your own cozy small business: designing stickers, fulfilling orders, and connecting with your customers' stories.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Embrace the rainbow and express your creativity with 95 new stickers, 12 fresh goodies, and 2 glitter papers. Also some Quality-of-Life improvements have been added to the update. You can now move elements with WASD, duplicate stickers & inventory tab!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🌈Spread the love in your shop like never before!🌈",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are proud to be part of the Steam Event \"Games Made Baked in Germany.\" 🥳🥳",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This celebration of German indie developers showcases some of the finest indie games from Germany to a global audience.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "➡️ Check out the 🌭 Games Germany 🌭 event page here!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you'll enjoy the little treat, happy stickering! And always remember: Love wins!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Yours,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Spellgarden Games & Assemble Entertainment",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
